From: MRizky099 <mrizky793@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] docking: compact groups with a grip

DockArea::compact(panel, GripSide::{Left, Top}) draws that panel, while it is
alone in a docked group, with a 10 px grip on one edge instead of a captioned
tab strip. The grip is its tab: it drags, takes drops, opens the panel menu and
carries the label for accessibility and as a hover tooltip. Floating, or
sharing a group, the panel gets an ordinary strip again. Nothing is compact
unless an application asks.
---
